      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "A completed cached run reuses existing stage evidence; it does not represent new training. Pipeline stage failures and parent-run failures are monitored separately.\n\nThe training threshold is calibrated for this CPU demonstration. Revisit it after measuring another machine. Registry promotion requires the adapter hash and pinned base identity to match the accepted generation evidence. Use MLflow to inspect losses, parameters and lineage."
